        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01014",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "决定我们命运的只有信仰、遭遇和机遇。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The only things that decide our fate are faith, circumstances, and chance.",
          "g": "predicate"
